Trinkets for Sunrise

A port of Trinkets 3.7.2 by Emi, C4.
Original source: https://github.com/emilyploszaj/trinkets
Original licence: MIT

Ported to Minecraft 26.3 by lavoide, with the rules re-implemented in Rust, and to Sunrise by arismoko, on Sunrise's
typed mod API (no game patches, no Java code). The slot pictures, models and language file, and the inventory popup frame and empty-slot icons, are carried over from the
original. This port is distributed under the same licence as the original (MIT); the licence text is in LICENSE.
